From 37934d46879ad3e1f031dd022cefad77282e3d7f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 10:58:39 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Add an encrypted native V2 Payment wallet and offline pilot
 helper

Bind SQLite storage to exact caller chain, genesis and validator identities. Generate and encrypt a fresh native key, register only its exact supported Payment policy, authenticate tracked funding, deterministically prepare one-coin native payments and recheck immutable FULL signing plans against the active store.

Validate ordinary transactions before atomically persisting outgoing bytes, input reservations and owned outputs. Reconcile current coin presence after restart/disconnect without inferring confirmation from retained bodies; fail closed after wallet write errors. Add synthetic-store API tests, real SQLite failure injection and a public-only helper using the shared development manifest adapter. Standalone builds enforce matching dependency headers/libraries.
